cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  Please cite BOTH the original Wang and Smith paper and the original MATLAB
  code archive listed in references. This repository is an independent Python
  translation; also record its URL and commit hash for reproducibility.
title: 'RHEEDsim Python: a translation of the original MATLAB code'
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Regmi
    given-names: Sijan
repository-code: 'https://github.com/regmi-sijan/RHEEDsim-Python'
abstract: >-
  Independent Python port of RHEEDsim by Kangkang Wang and Arthur R. Smith.
  The scientific method and original MATLAB implementation are credited to
  Wang and Smith. Python translation prepared with assistance from OpenAI Codex.
